            "value" : "Mit Tippen auf „Fortfahren“ stimmst du den Bedingungen der [Writion-Softwarelizenzvereinbarung](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/nhx100218/Writion-iOS/main/LICENSE) zu."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "By tapping “Continue”, you agree to the terms of the [Writion Software License Agreement](https://blog.nws.us.kg)."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "בהקשה על \"המשך\", אתה מסכים לתנאי [הסכם רישיון התוכנה של Writion](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/nhx100218/Writion-iOS/main/LICENSE)."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「続行」をタップすると、[Writionソフトウェアライセンス契約](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/nhx100218/Writion-iOS/main/LICENSE)の条項に同意したことになります。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "\"계속\"을 탭하면 [Writion 소프트웨어 라이선스 계약](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/nhx100218/Writion-iOS/main/LICENSE)의 조건에 동의하는 것입니다."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "การแตะ \"ดำเนินการต่อ\" แสดงว่าคุณยอมรับข้อกำหนดใน[ข้อตกลงสิทธิ์การใช้งานซอฟต์แวร์ Writion](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/nhx100218/Writion-iOS/main/LICENSE)"
